    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Vietnamese\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vietnamese</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternative_forms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternative forms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Etymology\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Etymology</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Pronunciation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pronunciation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Noun\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Noun</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Vietnamese\">Vietnamese</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Alternative_forms\">Alternative forms</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/tp.#Vietnamese\" title=\"tp.\">tp.</a></span>, <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/TP#Vietnamese\" title=\"TP\">TP</a></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3></div>\n<ul class=\"etymid\" id=\"Vietnamese:&#95;城庯\" data-lang=\"vi\" data-id=\"城庯\"></ul><p><a href=\"/wiki/Sino-Vietnamese\" title=\"Sino-Vietnamese\">Sino-Vietnamese</a>&#32;word from <i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%8E%E5%BA%AF#Vietnamese\" title=\"城庯\">城庯</a></i>, composed of&#32;<i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%8E#Vietnamese\" title=\"城\">城</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">city</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>&#32;and&#32;<i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%AF#Vietnamese\" title=\"庯\">庯</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">street</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.\n</p><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanoi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Hanoi\">Hà Nội</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[tʰajŋ̟˨˩ fo˧˦]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hu%E1%BA%BF\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Huế\">Huế</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[tʰɛɲ˦˩ fow˨˩˦]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon\">Saigon</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[tʰan˨˩ fow˦˥]</span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r50165410\">.mw-parser-output .k-player .k-attribution{visibility:hidden}</style><table class=\"audiotable\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; list-style: none; line-height: 1em; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0;\"><tbody><tr><td>Audio <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanoi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Hanoi\">Hà Nội</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span><span class=\"ib-colon qualifier-colon\">:</span></td><td class=\"audiofile\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><audio id=\"mwe_player_0\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" data-mw-tmh=\"\" class=\"mw-file-element\" width=\"175\" style=\"width:175px;\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"LL-Q9199_(vie)-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-thành_phố.wav\" data-mwprovider=\"wikimediacommons\"><source src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/LL-Q9199_%28vie%29-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91.wav/LL-Q9199_%28vie%29-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91.wav.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/LL-Q9199_%28vie%29-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91.wav/LL-Q9199_%28vie%29-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91.wav.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-transcodekey=\"mp3\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio></span></span></td><td class=\"audiometa\" style=\"font-size: 80%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/File:LL-Q9199_(vie)-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91.wav\" title=\"File:LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-thành phố.wav\">file</a>)</td></tr></tbody></table></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Noun\">Noun</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/th%C3%A0nh#Vietnamese\" title=\"thành\">thành</a> <a href=\"/wiki/ph%E1%BB%91#Vietnamese\" title=\"phố\">phố</a></strong></span> \n</p>\n<ol><li>a <a href=\"/wiki/city\" title=\"city\">city</a></li>\n<li>one of the <a href=\"/wiki/seven\" title=\"seven\">seven</a> <a href=\"/wiki/province\" title=\"province\">province</a>-<a href=\"/wiki/level\" title=\"level\">level</a> <a href=\"/wiki/subdivision\" title=\"subdivision\">subdivisions</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Vietnam\" title=\"Vietnam\">Vietnam</a> <a href=\"/wiki/label\" title=\"label\">labeled</a> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91_tr%E1%BB%B1c_thu%E1%BB%99c_trung_%C6%B0%C6%A1ng#Vietnamese\" title=\"thành phố trực thuộc trung ương\">thành phố trực thuộc trung ương</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span>literally <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">city under the central (national) government's direct management</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, namely <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/H%C3%A0_N%E1%BB%99i#Vietnamese\" title=\"Hà Nội\">Hà Nội</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hanoi\" title=\"Hanoi\">Hanoi</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/H%E1%BA%A3i_Ph%C3%B2ng#Vietnamese\" title=\"Hải Phòng\">Hải Phòng</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haiphong\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Haiphong\">Haiphong</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C4%90%C3%A0_N%E1%BA%B5ng#Vietnamese\" title=\"Đà Nẵng\">Đà Nẵng</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Da_Nang\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Da Nang\">Da Nang</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/Th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91_H%E1%BB%93_Ch%C3%AD_Minh#Vietnamese\" title=\"Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh\">Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ho_Chi_Minh_City\" title=\"Ho Chi Minh City\">Ho Chi Minh City</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/C%E1%BA%A7n_Th%C6%A1#Vietnamese\" title=\"Cần Thơ\">Cần Thơ</a></i>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hu%E1%BA%BF#Vietnamese\" title=\"Huế\">Huế</a></i> and <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C4%90%E1%BB%93ng_Nai#Vietnamese\" title=\"Đồng Nai\">Đồng Nai</a></i></li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#historical\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">historical</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> the <a href=\"/wiki/capital\" title=\"capital\">capital</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/Vietnamese\" title=\"Vietnamese\">Vietnamese</a> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/t%E1%BB%89nh#Vietnamese\" title=\"tỉnh\">tỉnh</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">province</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, labeled <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\">thành phố trực thuộc tỉnh</i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span>literally <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">city under a province's direct management</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>; itself is subdivided into <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/ph%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Dng#Vietnamese\" title=\"phường\">phường</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/ward\" title=\"ward\">wards</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#historical\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">historical</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> a subprovincial division of a <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91_tr%E1%BB%B1c_thu%E1%BB%99c_trung_%C6%B0%C6%A1ng#Vietnamese\" title=\"thành phố trực thuộc trung ương\">thành phố trực thuộc trung ương</a></i>, called <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91_thu%E1%BB%99c_th%C3%A0nh_ph%E1%BB%91_tr%E1%BB%B1c_thu%E1%BB%99c_trung_%C6%B0%C6%A1ng#Vietnamese\" title=\"thành phố thuộc thành phố trực thuộc trung ương\">thành phố thuộc thành phố trực thuộc trung ương</a></i>, that is larger than a <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/qu%E1%BA%ADn#Vietnamese\" title=\"quận\">quận</a></i> in terms of economic and population importance</li></ol></div>",
    "wikitext": "==Vietnamese==\n\n===Alternative forms===\n* {{l|vi|tp.}}, {{l|vi|TP}}\n\n===Etymology===\n{{vi-etym-sino|城|city|庯|street}}.\n\n===Pronunciation===\n{{vi-IPA}}\n* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-thành phố.wav|a=Hanoi}}\n\n===Noun===\n{{vi-noun}}\n\n# a [[city]]\n# one of the [[seven]] [[province]]-[[level]] [[subdivision]]s of [[Vietnam]] [[label]]ed {{m|vi|thành phố trực thuộc trung ương|lit=city under the central (national) government's direct management}}, namely {{m|vi|Hà Nội||[[Hanoi]]}}, {{m|vi|Hải Phòng||{{w|Haiphong}}}}, {{m|vi|Đà Nẵng||{{w|Da Nang}}}}, {{m|vi|Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh||[[Ho Chi Minh City]]}}, {{m|vi|Cần Thơ}}, {{m|vi|Huế}} and {{m|vi|Đồng Nai}}\n# {{lb|vi|historical}} the [[capital]] of a [[Vietnamese]] {{m|vi|tỉnh||province}}, labeled {{m|vi||thành phố trực thuộc tỉnh|lit=city under a province's direct management}}; itself is subdivided into {{m|vi|phường||[[ward]]s}}\n# {{lb|vi|historical}} a subprovincial division of a {{m|vi|thành phố trực thuộc trung ương}}, called {{m|vi|thành phố thuộc thành phố trực thuộc trung ương}}, that is larger than a {{m|vi|quận}} in terms of economic and population importance\n\n{{top|vi|Cities}}"
  }
